cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Fable Computer models or build on the design, please cite the
  manuscript(s) below and describe what you changed.
title: "The Fable Computer: models and manuscripts"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Furui
    given-names: Ryoji
    email: info@ryoji.info
    website: https://www.ryoji.info
    affiliation: Nano Fusion Design
repository-code: https://github.com/ryoji-info/FableComputer
license: Apache-2.0
preferred-citation:
  type: report
  title: >-
    The Fable Computer: A Room-Temperature Terahertz Half Adder on a
    Regenerative Graphene-Plasmon Logic Fabric — Concept, Architecture, and
    Reduced-Order Feasibility
  authors:
    - family-names: Furui
      given-names: Ryoji
  year: 2026
  month: 7
  version: v6.0
  doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21606810
  url: https://github.com/ryoji-info/FableComputer/blob/main/papers/Fable-Computer-Part-I.pdf
  notes: >-
    Not peer-reviewed; claims are in-model (reduced-order chain, reproducible
    from this repository). The manuscripts are living documents: the community's
    promoted notes (notes/) are folded back into them in periodic community
    revisions, each archived on Zenodo under its own version DOI. The DOI above is the
    v6.0 deposit, which is the same text as the copy in this repository. Earlier
    version DOIs continue to resolve to the manuscripts as they stood. The
    manuscripts carry no in-document version statements; versions, deposit DOIs and
    the full revision history live in papers/REVISION-HISTORY.md, and
    papers/ERRATA.md reports any adopted correction not yet in the current deposit. For the quantum extension, cite Part II (see
    references).
references:
  - type: report
    title: >-
      The Fable Computer, Part II: Quantum-Limited Analog Tensor Processing
      on the Regenerative Graphene-Plasmon Fabric
    authors:
      - family-names: Furui
        given-names: Ryoji
    year: 2026
    month: 7
    version: v2.0
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21607070
    url: https://github.com/ryoji-info/FableComputer/blob/main/papers/Fable-Computer-Part-II.pdf
